# Firebase per-app config files stay local only (they carry project-specific
# keys and OAuth client IDs). Drop your own copies in place before a native
# build; see docs/FIREBASE_GOOGLE_AUTH.md.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

# Firebase Admin / service-account keys must never be committed. If one was
# ever committed or shared, revoke and rotate it in the Firebase console.
*firebase-adminsdk*
*service-account*

